sec='''<section id="engine">
<h2>One Engine, Three Answers</h2>
<p class="proof">A clean container and stored commands answer three questions a docs owner asks.</p>
<div class="ea">
  <article class="ea-c gl rv">
    <h3>Does my quickstart work?</h3>
    <div class="ea-v"><div class="ea-loop">Break <i>&rarr;</i> Fix <i>&rarr;</i> Prove</div></div>
    <p>Runs the page in a fresh container, patches what breaks, and proves the patch.</p>
    <code>firstrun &lt;url&gt;</code>
    <a class="more" href="run.html#ex=fixture">Replay a broken fixture</a>
  </article>
  <article class="ea-c gl rv">
    <h3>Which release broke it?</h3>
    <div class="ea-v"><div class="ea-dots" role="img" aria-label="jafgen releases: 0.2.1 and 0.3.1 pass, 0.4.6, 0.4.10 and 0.4.14 fail">
